# Victory — the map is hers.
# D Phrygian dominant, the title's mode, 132 BPM. The pulse sweeps up the D major
# chord to D6 and sighs to Eb and back, then her leitmotif turns triumphant: the
# tritone falls to G# over her Bb chord and leans into A over A, and the
# Phrygian dominant cadence (bII V I) lands on D major, her voice on the fifth.

